Subject: config: keep the deprecated sus_su disabled
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [upstream still defaults sus_su to 2 for SUSFS 1.x kernels]
Drop-when: upstream defaults sus_su to -1 on SUSFS 2.x

SUSFS 2.x removed sus_su and this package does not ship it; -1 keeps
service.sh and the WebUI from trying to enable it.
---
diff --git a/config.sh b/config.sh
index 9f83c3cbb0376887faaeaef05543f5e3c5c22251..0a0b9670eba3a40fb2626ed472694e69e81db391 100644
--- a/config.sh
+++ b/config.sh
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 susfs_log=1
-sus_su=2
-sus_su_active=2
+sus_su=-1
+sus_su_active=-1
 hide_cusrom=0
 hide_vendor_sepolicy=0
 hide_compat_matrix=0
